For a start, try something like this:

library(ggplot2)
theme_set(theme_bw())
ggplot(newdat,aes(a,b))+geom_point(aes(size=N))+geom_smooth(method="lm")

...which plots the points, with size scaled by N, and adds a linear fit line.

Ben

